  "description": "firebase/storage metadata-only updateMetadata(ref, patch) security-rules request.method binding (#1884): records production ALLOW/DENY verdicts on the same seeded object under allow write gated by request.method == \"create\" versus request.method == \"update\", alongside granular allow create versus allow update.",
